    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a mooj</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.mp4?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Garden of Mooj is a cute 3D sandbox game with in depth life simulation. Guide your mooj as they breed and evolve over time, unlocking new structures for your garden.<br><br>Or, just relax and play with your mooj for a bit.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Each mooj is completely unique, with their own name, pattern, coloring, and more<br></li><li> Manage your mooj's diet carefully to control their evolution<br></li><li> Forage for food throughout the garden, with over 100 unique foods to discover<br></li><li> Defend from monsters at night<br></li><li> Compete in mooj races for hats<br></li><li> Discover forgotten secrets by raising specific types of mooj<br></li><li> Construct various buildings to increase your garden's revenue</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.mp4?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/5f03e5f18bc94eb8b75ce313f07f2e1b.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/5f03e5f18bc94eb8b75ce313f07f2e1b.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/5f03e5f18bc94eb8b75ce313f07f2e1b.mp4?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This is a mooj</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/d601c83252d246c2294bd334586896ee.mp4?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Garden of Mooj is a cute 3D sandbox game with in depth life simulation. Guide your mooj as they breed and evolve over time, unlocking new structures for your garden.<br><br>Or, just relax and play with your mooj for a bit.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Each mooj is completely unique, with their own name, pattern, coloring, and more<br></li><li> Manage your mooj's diet carefully to control their evolution<br></li><li> Forage for food throughout the garden, with over 100 unique foods to discover<br></li><li> Defend from monsters at night<br></li><li> Compete in mooj races for hats<br></li><li> Discover forgotten secrets by raising specific types of mooj<br></li><li> Construct various buildings to increase your garden's revenue</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/fbb5d9861faf67ebe5a6dce64ed0b956.mp4?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/5f03e5f18bc94eb8b75ce313f07f2e1b.poster.avif?t=1633530509\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/5f03e5f18bc94eb8b75ce313f07f2e1b.webm?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044760/extras/5f03e5f18bc94eb8b75ce313f07f2e1b.mp4?t=1633530509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
